{"id": "t058-060", "text": "demi had her interview at the bank on tuesday, 3rd round. she thought it went ok but they asked a lot of stuff abt spreadsheets. also her mum had her hip op on the 12th and is home now but can't do stairs, demi's been staying over. ask her how the interview went, and whether her mum's recovering ok", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "demi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't do stairs", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "demi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how the interview went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "whether her mum's recovering ok", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
